WEBVTT

00:01:58.656 --> 00:02:01.909
in the environment
in which they need to live and work,

00:02:01.951 --> 00:02:04.829
then we could potentially save
years of wasted effort

00:02:04.871 --> 00:02:07.123
and produce robots
that are uniquely adapted

00:02:07.165 --> 00:02:09.500
to the environments
that they find themselves in.

00:02:11.669 --> 00:02:15.715
So to realize this technology,
we've been turning to nature for help.

00:02:16.841 --> 00:02:18.050
All around us,

00:02:18.092 --> 00:02:21.095
we see examples of biological species

00:02:21.095 --> 00:02:23.306
that have evolved smart adaptations

00:02:23.306 --> 00:02:26.058
that enable them to thrive
in a given environment.

